Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Goku joined the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:01.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Avengers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Earth's insurance company is\Ncooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:04.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tony sees the hair and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,asks, is that in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,dress code?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Brother, your team hired a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,green rage fridge. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this crossover, Thor calls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,himself a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Goku hears free training\Npartner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,The welcome party now needs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:18.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,a demolition permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Captain America says they need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:20.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,My guy, this man thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,strategy means screaming until\Nhis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,hair updates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:25.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then they order lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Motherflicker, they need a\Nsecond budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Goku calls it a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:29.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tony calls his accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thanos starts the usual galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Goku asks, are you strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,or just purple and unemployed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,All that villain aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:37.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Suddenly he is getting checked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,like carry on luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,But Goku gives the bad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,guy a chance to power up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:43.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Oh, fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Our emergency has a premium
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:45.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:46.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Avengers are begging him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:47.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,to finish the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:48.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,He wants a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.87,0:00:50.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,This walking side quest needs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:51.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,adult supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.43,0:00:52.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Still, they would want him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.31,0:00:53.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,protecting Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Just keep him away from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,mission planning and the grocery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:56.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,card.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:57.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Would he save the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:00:59.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,or bankrupt it before the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:00:59.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,next invasion?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.82,Heading,,0,0,0,,EARTH IS FINANCIALLY COOKED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.82,0:00:06.77,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE DRESS CODE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.77,0:00:09.80,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE GREEN RAGE FRIDGE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.80,0:00:14.15,Heading,,0,0,0,,FREE TRAINING PARTNER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.15,0:00:17.96,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE WELCOME PARTY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.96,Heading,,0,0,0,,CAPTAIN HAS A PLAN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.96,0:00:23.78,Heading,,0,0,0,,SCREAMING IS NOT A STRATEGY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.78,0:00:26.89,Heading,,0,0,0,,LUNCH REQUIRES FUNDING
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.89,0:00:29.71,Heading,,0,0,0,,CALL THE ACCOUNTANT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.71,0:00:31.96,Heading,,0,0,0,,HERE COMES THE SPEECH
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.96,0:00:35.14,Heading,,0,0,0,,PURPLE AND UNEMPLOYED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.14,0:00:39.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,AURA MEETS AIRPORT SECURITY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.63,Heading,,0,0,0,,HE LETS THE VILLAIN POWER UP
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.63,0:00:45.11,Heading,,0,0,0,,PREMIUM EMERGENCY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.11,0:00:47.57,Heading,,0,0,0,,PLEASE FINISH THE FIGHT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.57,0:00:51.37,Heading,,0,0,0,,WALKING SIDE QUEST
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.37,0:00:53.36,Heading,,0,0,0,,EARTH STILL NEEDS A HERO
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.36,0:00:56.54,Heading,,0,0,0,,CONFISCATE THE GROCERY CARD
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.54,0:01:00.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,SAVE THE TEAM OR BANKRUPT IT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:00.00,Brand,,0,0,0,,IFVERSE ANIME / FAN WHAT-IF
